WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.838
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03.108 --> 00:07.571
RED LIGHT ELEGY

3
00:09.072 --> 00:11.325
All right, going in.

4
00:11.408 --> 00:13.118
EPISODE 4

5
00:13.201 --> 00:14.202
[Satoshi] Okay.

6
00:17.539 --> 00:19.875
-[customer 1 chuckles] -[indistinct whispering]

7
00:24.546 --> 00:27.758
[customer 2] Hey, you're cool today too.

8
00:29.468 --> 00:31.136
[customer 3] You're so cute!

9
00:38.018 --> 00:39.728
Wanna go somewhere else?

10
00:40.604 --> 00:41.605
Yeah, let's go.

11
00:43.523 --> 00:45.942
THE LOVE EXAM TABLE (5 ROOMS) GUILLOTINE RESTRAINTS (ROOM 202/206/210)

12
00:46.026 --> 00:48.445
BACK-BOUND RESTRAINTS (ROOM 203/305) V-SHAPE LEG SPREADER (ROOM 203/308)

13
00:48.528 --> 00:51.448
ALL ROOMS FULLY UPGRADED WITH REAL BDSM GEAR!!

14
00:56.620 --> 01:00.457
No, no, no! They're for advanced users, right?

15
01:01.041 --> 01:03.210
-What are "advanced users"? -[chuckles] No.

16
01:03.293 --> 01:05.003
-What are we doing then? -Eh?

17
01:05.087 --> 01:07.631
Let's try somewhere else. Just go somewhere else.

18
01:09.549 --> 01:12.552
This place won't do. The reviews are all bad.

19
01:13.136 --> 01:15.055
Aren't they all the same anyway?

20
01:15.389 --> 01:17.349
A good atmosphere is better, right?

21
01:17.933 --> 01:21.812
I'd prefer it to be a light post-meal workout.

22
01:23.230 --> 01:25.440
I'm not used to this like you are, Chiko.

23
01:25.524 --> 01:29.736
Idiot! Don't make me sound like a whore. I'm not that experienced either!

24
01:29.820 --> 01:31.655
I didn't mean it like that!

25
01:37.160 --> 01:41.206
So now what? Looks like there's nothing down this road.

26
01:47.421 --> 01:48.713
[Chiko sighs]

27
01:56.638 --> 01:58.223
[car horn honking]

28
01:59.558 --> 02:02.811
[shouts] Shut up and drive past, asshole! [tuts]

29
02:04.354 --> 02:07.357
So? Go right or left?

30
02:07.441 --> 02:08.859
I'm looking it up right now!

31
02:09.609 --> 02:11.820
Anywhere is fine, just hurry up and decide.

32
02:15.073 --> 02:16.825
Chiko, you're smoking way too much!

33
02:18.034 --> 02:19.578
It's smoky. You'll get cancer.

34
02:27.711 --> 02:29.379
[blowing air]

35
02:32.048 --> 02:34.551
Forget it. We're going home.

36
02:35.510 --> 02:39.264
Huh? Wait. Why?

37
02:40.682 --> 02:43.477
[Satoshi] Where to, Chiko? You don't even know the way, right?

38
02:43.560 --> 02:46.229
-[Chiko] It's a shortcut, a shortcut. -[Satoshi] What?

39
02:48.899 --> 02:50.859
Are you sure this road is fine?

40
02:53.862 --> 02:56.490
-You're totally lost. -[Chiko] Shut up, I don't care!

41
02:59.534 --> 03:00.702
[tires screeching]

42
03:00.786 --> 03:02.621
-[Satoshi exclaims, grunts] -[thumps]

43
03:02.704 --> 03:04.706
[truck beeping]

44
03:08.210 --> 03:10.962
-[Satoshi] Ready, set, go! [grunts] -[engine revving]

45
03:15.258 --> 03:17.260
Ready, set, go! [grunts]

46
03:19.137 --> 03:21.598
[grunts, groans]

47
03:21.681 --> 03:23.141
Damn, this is the worst!

48
03:23.225 --> 03:24.726
[panting]

49
03:24.810 --> 03:28.438
-Gosh. We're totally stuck. -[truck door closes]

50
03:28.522 --> 03:30.273
[Chiko] What a streak of bad luck.

51
03:32.150 --> 03:34.361
That's because you took this road!

52
03:35.070 --> 03:37.197
And you brought up going to a hotel!

53
03:38.240 --> 03:40.492
We should've just stayed put and waited!

54
03:40.575 --> 03:43.870
-There! What the hell are you doing? -Ouch!

55
03:45.789 --> 03:48.625
[both grunting]

56
03:52.796 --> 03:54.047
[muffled yell]

57
04:11.189 --> 04:12.440
Can we stop fighting?

58
04:14.442 --> 04:15.443
[Chiko] Yeah.

59
04:21.241 --> 04:22.701
It was my fault.

60
04:24.327 --> 04:27.831
I didn't want to mess up, so I overthought everything.

61
04:29.291 --> 04:30.458
[Satoshi sneezes]

62
04:31.126 --> 04:34.629
[coughs, sniffling]

63
04:38.884 --> 04:42.012
You always overcomplicate things, really.

64
04:45.432 --> 04:47.475
There's no mood left here.

65
04:48.184 --> 04:49.436
[chuckles]

66
04:52.856 --> 04:55.191
[♪ soft music playing]

67
05:25.847 --> 05:27.432
[Satoshi] It's not coming off.

68
05:37.651 --> 05:39.444
[Chiko] Don't stare like that.

69
05:40.028 --> 05:43.907
[Satoshi] Right. Sorry. My bad.

70
05:54.459 --> 05:56.628
[♪ soft music continues]

71
06:05.845 --> 06:07.347
-[Chiko gasps] -Huh?

72
06:07.430 --> 06:09.099
[Chiko] Where are you putting your face?

73
06:09.182 --> 06:11.101
-Eh? -[Chiko] None of that tonight.

74
06:11.184 --> 06:13.019
Wait, for real?

75
06:14.312 --> 06:16.606
I thought everyone did that.

76
06:16.690 --> 06:19.067
-[Chiko] Dumbass. -Sorry.

77
06:25.865 --> 06:28.284
[♪ soft music continues]

78
06:39.587 --> 06:41.923
[insects chirping]

79
06:45.760 --> 06:47.554
[Chiko] The rain stopped.

80
06:49.305 --> 06:50.306
[Satoshi] Yeah.

81
06:55.687 --> 06:56.771
Chiko!

82
06:59.232 --> 07:01.943
[Chiko] Don't be such a chicken. There's no one around.

83
07:14.831 --> 07:18.209
Truth is... I was pretty scared too.

84
07:21.087 --> 07:22.338
You were?

85
07:24.174 --> 07:28.553
With my ex, we got along right after we met.

86
07:30.221 --> 07:31.556
I'd never felt that way.

87
07:34.601 --> 07:35.935
We moved in together,

88
07:37.312 --> 07:38.813
fought like crazy,

89
07:40.482 --> 07:44.110
went through a ton of painful stuff, and finally split up.

90
07:46.362 --> 07:47.906
I thought I'd feel relieved.

91
07:51.284 --> 07:52.577
But you know...

92
07:56.664 --> 07:58.458
once he was gone,

93
08:02.086 --> 08:03.713
it was even harder

94
08:05.632 --> 08:07.050
and more painful.

95
08:09.260 --> 08:11.513
[♪ somber music playing]

96
08:11.596 --> 08:13.640
Once was enough for me.

97
08:19.020 --> 08:22.106
When I started dating you, I thought I was ready.

98
08:24.984 --> 08:25.985
But now...

99
08:28.446 --> 08:29.572
I'm not quite sure.

100
08:43.002 --> 08:44.003
Chiko.

101
08:51.136 --> 08:52.595
Let's live together.

102
09:20.540 --> 09:23.543
[Chiko's mom scoffs] A screwed-up family?

103
09:27.755 --> 09:29.507
[Chiko] Dad's debt collector again?

104
09:31.384 --> 09:33.636
They never get tired of this.

105
09:33.720 --> 09:38.016
[Chiko's mom] Maybe I should leave it up and save myself the hassle.

106
09:38.099 --> 09:40.351
Think Dad will be stumbling back home soon?

107
09:40.852 --> 09:42.687
I'll kick right to his ass.

108
09:44.272 --> 09:47.233
But you look so pleased with yourself.

109
09:47.859 --> 09:50.695
Home in the morning with a hickey on your neck?

110
09:50.778 --> 09:52.113
What? [gasps]

111
09:52.197 --> 09:53.823
Just kidding, just kidding.

112
09:54.866 --> 09:55.867
You old hag!

113
09:57.577 --> 10:00.705
What, so you're really dating that guy?

114
10:02.373 --> 10:03.374
[Chiko] Yeah.

115
10:05.043 --> 10:06.669
I'm staying with him from today,

116
10:07.170 --> 10:08.588
so don't worry about dinner.

117
10:13.301 --> 10:14.928
Then take this with you,

118
10:17.805 --> 10:19.182
your pay for this month.

119
10:21.184 --> 10:22.560
A bit greasy though.

120
10:24.354 --> 10:27.690
SHITTY FAMILY. THAT LANDLORD TRASH WON'T REFUND ME.

121
10:28.608 --> 10:30.610
[Chiko] I'll still come help with work.

122
10:32.570 --> 10:34.405
Don't push yourself too hard.

123
10:36.783 --> 10:38.576
YANAGAWA

124
10:39.577 --> 10:40.703
AKIYAMA

125
10:47.710 --> 10:52.924
Mm! So good! Thanks for the food. Good, right?

126
10:53.258 --> 10:54.759
-Yeah. -I know.

127
10:55.802 --> 10:58.638
It's just regular wakame soup with extra egg.

128
10:59.097 --> 11:00.348
My dad used to love it.

129
11:06.104 --> 11:08.523
[deep inhale] Chiko.

130
11:09.649 --> 11:11.567
Let's get along from now on.

131
11:12.986 --> 11:14.696
See, always dramatic.

132
11:15.571 --> 11:16.614
Thanks for the meal.

133
11:17.532 --> 11:19.033
No, leave it to me.

134
11:19.993 --> 11:21.911
-Appreciate it. -Sure thing. [chuckles]

135
11:29.419 --> 11:31.379
[Satoshi] How late is the snack bar open?

136
11:31.462 --> 11:34.090
[Chiko] I don't know. If I'm late, go to sleep first.

137
11:34.966 --> 11:37.051
-Oh, the keys. -Hmm?

138
11:38.469 --> 11:40.346
Which one should I take?

139
11:40.680 --> 11:42.181
Well, either one is fine.

140
11:42.682 --> 11:43.683
Wait.

141
11:44.809 --> 11:45.935
[Satoshi] There it is.

142
11:47.270 --> 11:48.271
I bought this

143
11:48.813 --> 11:51.232
at a gift shop in Ise when we went there.

144
11:52.525 --> 11:53.985
Here, it's yours.

145
11:55.778 --> 11:57.030
[Inaba] All right, everyone!

146
11:57.113 --> 12:00.950
Our young boy here finally lost his virginity!

147
12:01.034 --> 12:02.994
[all cheering]

148
12:03.077 --> 12:06.706
[workers] Way to go, Satoshi!

149
12:06.789 --> 12:08.416
[worker 1] Awesome!

150
12:08.499 --> 12:09.751
[worker 2] That's the way!

151
12:09.834 --> 12:13.296
Thanks, everyone. [chuckles]

152
12:13.379 --> 12:18.343
Let's celebrate your milestone tonight. Actually, I have a go-to snack bar.

153
12:18.426 --> 12:19.844
Let me take you there.

154
12:19.927 --> 12:22.138
-A snack bar? -Right. Snack bars are great.

155
12:22.221 --> 12:25.433
They're full of women with lonely hearts.

156
12:25.516 --> 12:30.396
I've seduced plenty of them. They used to call me "a paper of Ikoma".

157
12:31.064 --> 12:34.567
I stick to the holes in their hearts and seal them up.

158
12:35.026 --> 12:37.153
After that, it's just a matter of time!

159
12:37.236 --> 12:38.696
[laughs]

160
12:39.864 --> 12:41.199
Something wrong?

161
12:41.282 --> 12:43.242
No, it's nothing. [chuckles]

162
12:43.326 --> 12:46.120
Just... I remembered that I have plans tonight.

163
12:46.204 --> 12:47.789
I got it!

164
12:47.872 --> 12:49.916
-Back to Chiko-chan already? -Well...

165
12:49.999 --> 12:53.961
-My bad, maybe next time then. -Okay. I'm sorry.

166
13:00.426 --> 13:04.138
Oh my, Chiko-chan! Aren't you stunning!

167
13:04.222 --> 13:06.808
So cute! Yes, you look nice!

168
13:06.891 --> 13:10.937
The first time my Hiroyuki's done a nice thing for his mom. [sniffles]

169
13:11.020 --> 13:15.608
All the girls here suddenly quit, so I was in a real bind.

170
13:16.734 --> 13:19.529
So, what am I supposed to do?

171
13:19.612 --> 13:25.368
It's easy! Just sit by the customer and smile sweetly, whatever they say.

172
13:25.868 --> 13:27.912
Charm is everything for girls!

173
13:29.747 --> 13:30.873
[owner chuckles]

174
13:30.957 --> 13:33.126
Handsome, many pretty girls in here!

175
13:33.209 --> 13:34.252
Well, that's all right.

176
13:34.335 --> 13:36.879
-I'm not here for girls. -Why not?

177
13:36.963 --> 13:40.842
-You came to the right place, buddy! -Huh?

178
13:40.925 --> 13:43.761
We've got a table. Just come and drink!

179
13:43.845 --> 13:47.473
I have to go to my girlfriend's bar. I'm trying to find it.

180
13:47.557 --> 13:52.812
Yeah, right. I got it! I know! Table for one, please!

181
13:52.895 --> 13:55.481
[owner] Mr. Mura! [chuckles]

182
13:55.565 --> 14:00.486
Oh? A newcomer? Aren't you a beauty!

183
14:00.570 --> 14:02.321
First pretty girl here, Mama.

184
14:02.405 --> 14:06.576
-That's rude! Chiko-chan, sit next to him. -[Mura laughs]

185
14:08.786 --> 14:10.079
[Mama chuckles]

186
14:10.163 --> 14:12.290
Can I get a drink too?

187
14:12.373 --> 14:14.000
[laughter]

188
14:14.083 --> 14:16.586
From the start? Interesting, Mama.

189
14:17.628 --> 14:21.632
What did I teach you, Chiko-chan? Smile, smile!

190
14:23.176 --> 14:24.635
Welcome.

191
14:24.719 --> 14:27.013
[Mura chuckles] That's it!

192
14:28.723 --> 14:30.683
[staff 1] First time at a place like this?

193
14:31.142 --> 14:32.143
Yeah, pretty much.

194
14:32.226 --> 14:36.022
Are you blushing? That's cute!

195
14:36.314 --> 14:37.565
What are you drinking?

196
14:37.899 --> 14:40.610
Eh? I shouldn't! I have somewhere to go!

197
14:40.693 --> 14:42.445
You just got here.

198
14:42.528 --> 14:43.988
Don't you like us?

199
14:44.071 --> 14:46.657
No, it's not that at all.

200
14:46.741 --> 14:48.326
[staff 2] Right?

201
14:48.701 --> 14:52.121
A beauty on each arm, no way you'd hate that.

202
14:52.997 --> 14:54.916
I'll make you a shochu with water.

203
14:55.541 --> 14:58.502
No, but I... just that... I'm sorry.

204
14:58.586 --> 15:00.796
Where are you rushing off to?

205
15:02.673 --> 15:05.051
My girlfriend started working at a snack bar,

206
15:05.134 --> 15:09.180
and I'm unsure what kind of place it is. She didn't know when to finish, either.

207
15:09.263 --> 15:11.557
[staff 1] So you got worried and came to pick her up?

208
15:11.641 --> 15:14.352
[chuckles] What a great boyfriend!

209
15:14.435 --> 15:18.189
Totally different from mine. He hits me the second he gets mad.

210
15:19.649 --> 15:22.902
Well, in my case, I'm more on the getting-hit side.

211
15:22.985 --> 15:27.406
[chuckles] You totally look like a henpecked guy.

212
15:27.490 --> 15:30.660
I mean, Chiko is really reliable,

213
15:30.826 --> 15:35.122
way stronger than me, and I know she can handle herself.

214
15:35.957 --> 15:39.168
You lack confidence, so you're anxious, right?

215
15:41.921 --> 15:44.757
Chiko had another guy before,

216
15:46.092 --> 15:48.177
but I only have Chiko.

217
15:50.221 --> 15:54.809
For some reason, I feel she'll just drift away if this keeps up.

218
15:56.227 --> 15:57.228
You are...

219
15:58.521 --> 15:59.981
way too sweet.

220
16:03.734 --> 16:06.279
[staff 2] Maki-chan, what are you doing?

221
16:06.988 --> 16:07.989
Huh?

222
16:09.365 --> 16:11.450
[Maki] The restroom?

223
16:12.201 --> 16:15.204
It's in the back. [chuckles]

224
16:15.788 --> 16:17.665
No jerking off in there!

225
16:17.748 --> 16:18.749
[laughter]

226
16:18.833 --> 16:21.460
-[staff 2] Looks like he actually might! -Right?

227
16:23.379 --> 16:24.588
[sighs]

228
16:26.424 --> 16:27.508
[door opens]

229
16:32.722 --> 16:34.724
So, what did you want to talk about?

230
16:41.188 --> 16:42.773
[spluttering]

231
16:44.525 --> 16:46.569
I... I have a girlfriend!

232
16:47.069 --> 16:48.362
[laughing]

233
16:48.446 --> 16:51.657
-You remember it well, don't you? -[Mama] Seriously, that was ages ago!

234
16:51.741 --> 16:54.994
-I have a great memory. [laughs] -[Mama] Stop it! [laughs]

235
16:56.287 --> 16:58.414
Hey, rookie. Chiko, was it?

236
16:59.582 --> 17:02.418
Say something clever to entertain me.

237
17:03.836 --> 17:04.920
Well...

238
17:05.921 --> 17:09.717
No good! You've gotta fire back right away to make it funny.

239
17:10.343 --> 17:12.261
Whatever, stand up for a second.

240
17:13.262 --> 17:14.555
Hey, get up!

241
17:19.393 --> 17:21.187
Hey, what the hell?

242
17:21.771 --> 17:25.024
What? You can't even handle basic hostessing,

243
17:25.107 --> 17:27.151
so at least offer me this service!

244
17:27.234 --> 17:28.736
That's not included.

245
17:28.819 --> 17:32.073
[Mama] Come on, Mr. Mura. Don't bully our newbie.

246
17:32.156 --> 17:36.994
Huh? Don't make me look bad. This is all part of her training!

247
17:37.078 --> 17:41.290
Chiko-chan, he's just joking. Calm down.

248
17:42.166 --> 17:45.670
-Here, sit! Sit down. -[Chiko sighs]

249
17:46.629 --> 17:48.464
Must be nice having a pretty face,

250
17:49.382 --> 17:53.052
making money just sitting around and sipping free drinks. [chuckles]

251
17:54.428 --> 17:55.971
But mark my words,

252
17:56.681 --> 18:00.518
that's only for now, before you get washed up like Mama.

253
18:00.601 --> 18:05.523
Look at that makeup, so thick you look like a monster!

254
18:05.606 --> 18:07.942
Oh my, that's so mean.

255
18:08.025 --> 18:10.653
Well, maybe I'm just as bad

256
18:10.736 --> 18:12.738
-for coming to a dump like this. -Indeed.

257
18:12.822 --> 18:14.782
[laughter]

258
18:16.867 --> 18:19.412
Hey, rookie, how much are you?

259
18:20.037 --> 18:23.207
-How much to get you in my bed? -[Mama] Mr. Mura!

260
18:23.290 --> 18:26.585
Mister, this isn't that kind of place.

261
18:26.669 --> 18:28.796
Don't play so hard to get!

262
18:30.256 --> 18:34.009
Once I get hard, you'll be moaning in pleasure!

263
18:34.510 --> 18:36.011
[moaning]

264
18:36.095 --> 18:38.931
-"It's my first time." [laughs] -[Mama] Mr. Mura, that's enough.

265
18:39.014 --> 18:40.725
-You've drunk too much. -All right.

266
18:40.808 --> 18:44.228
-You're mine tonight! -Way too much. Let's call it a night.

267
18:44.311 --> 18:47.898
[exclaims] Don't let an auntie mix the drinks. It'll taste awful!

268
18:48.315 --> 18:49.942
-No! -[grunts] Cold!

269
18:50.693 --> 18:53.154
-What's with that girly voice? -[Mama chuckles]

270
18:53.237 --> 18:55.281
[Mura laughs, moans]

271
18:55.364 --> 18:58.367
-Are you a young maiden? [laughs] -[awkward chuckle]

272
19:01.036 --> 19:02.204
-Auntie. -[Mama] Huh?

273
19:02.997 --> 19:04.832
-Forgive me. -[Mama] Huh?

274
19:04.915 --> 19:07.042
[Mura laughing]

275
19:07.877 --> 19:12.256
Hey, forgive you for what? [laughing]

276
19:12.757 --> 19:13.841
[gasps]

277
19:14.425 --> 19:17.178
[breathing heavily]

278
19:17.261 --> 19:19.013
Hey, you old piece of shit,

279
19:19.096 --> 19:23.726
who the hell do you think you are?

280
19:25.394 --> 19:26.395
[Maki shushes]

281
19:28.189 --> 19:30.566
Listen, this place is just

282
19:31.442 --> 19:34.028
a rip-off joint run by mobsters.

283
19:35.404 --> 19:36.447
What?

284
19:37.156 --> 19:39.408
Some scary guys are in the back room.

285
19:40.409 --> 19:43.454
You look soft. They'll simply bleed you for 200,000 yen.

286
19:44.747 --> 19:47.625
No way. [breathing anxiously]

287
19:47.708 --> 19:49.585
[loudly] What should I do?

288
19:49.668 --> 19:51.545
[whispers] Keep it down!

289
19:51.629 --> 19:52.630
[sighs]

290
19:53.380 --> 19:55.341
Here, come this way.

291
20:01.263 --> 20:05.017
-Use the back door. Run for your life. -Wait.

292
20:05.726 --> 20:07.895
If I do this, are you gonna be okay?

293
20:08.395 --> 20:12.900
Who knows? But you look like a lost puppy. [chuckles]

294
20:12.983 --> 20:14.777
I feel so sorry for you.

295
20:17.613 --> 20:19.323
Come escape with me!

296
20:20.366 --> 20:21.492
[soft chuckle]

297
20:22.201 --> 20:24.537
Nice line, thanks.

298
20:26.080 --> 20:28.999
But this job was set up by my boyfriend.

299
20:29.583 --> 20:32.628
He'll get in trouble if I run.

300
20:34.421 --> 20:36.674
[distant indistinct chatter]

301
20:36.757 --> 20:41.262
[gasps] Hurry! Go save your girl!

302
20:46.225 --> 20:48.727
[mobster 1] That guy's not in the restroom!

303
20:50.062 --> 20:51.397
[mobster 2] What? Really?

304
21:09.373 --> 21:12.376
-[banging] -[indistinct clamoring]

305
21:12.459 --> 21:13.460
Chiko?

306
21:14.503 --> 21:15.588
[door bell jingles]

307
21:15.671 --> 21:18.299
-I'm never coming back, shit! -Eh?

308
21:18.382 --> 21:19.383
Chiko.

309
21:19.466 --> 21:23.888
[Chiko] Don't you walk away from me! I'll kill you, you asshole!

310
21:23.971 --> 21:27.433
-[Mama] Chiko-chan, that's enough! -Ouch!

311
21:27.516 --> 21:29.351
[panting]

312
21:30.895 --> 21:32.146
Satoshi?

313
21:36.567 --> 21:38.444
[Mama] No pay for tonight.

314
21:40.070 --> 21:41.614
[Chiko] I'm really sorry.

315
21:47.119 --> 21:50.581
I told you to just smile no matter what.

316
21:51.832 --> 21:54.126
If you take their words to heart,

317
21:54.585 --> 21:56.045
you'll never be a hostess.

318
21:58.255 --> 21:59.465
[Chiko] Mm.

319
22:01.216 --> 22:02.384
[sighs]

320
22:02.468 --> 22:03.636
That's enough.

321
22:03.719 --> 22:05.554
Your boyfriend's here anyway, so head on home.

322
22:05.638 --> 22:06.972
[Chiko] No, I'll finish.

323
22:07.056 --> 22:08.891
[Mama] It's fine!

324
22:08.974 --> 22:12.144
I'll lend you that dress tonight, so you two go have some fun.

325
22:12.227 --> 22:13.395
Huh?

326
22:13.479 --> 22:15.564
[Mama] Ah! Hey, kid!

327
22:17.608 --> 22:19.485
Want me to lend her this one too?

328
22:21.987 --> 22:22.988
For real?

329
22:23.072 --> 22:25.658
[Mama chuckling] You look so excited!

330
22:25.741 --> 22:29.036
-Auntie, what are you even saying? -[chuckling continues]

331
22:31.080 --> 22:33.082
You got mad on my behalf, right?

332
22:34.833 --> 22:35.876
[scoffs]

333
22:38.045 --> 22:42.883
That guy will be back in a few days. No worries.

334
22:45.135 --> 22:47.888
MINERUBA SNACK BAR

335
22:54.228 --> 22:55.229
[Chiko sighs]

336
22:56.563 --> 22:58.440
There's a lot to the nightlife world.

337
22:58.816 --> 23:01.068
[Chiko] Act like you know everything.

338
23:12.997 --> 23:15.708
Chiko, that dress looks nice on you.

339
23:15.791 --> 23:16.917
Shut up.

340
23:22.006 --> 23:24.591
Wait, can I take a quick photo? [chuckles]

341
23:24.675 --> 23:25.968
-You're persistent! -[giggles]

342
23:26.593 --> 23:31.682
[Satoshi chuckling] Why not? It's rare! Hey, wait!

343
23:35.769 --> 23:40.691
OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICKS, RAMEN AND YAKIMESHI (JAPANESE FRIED RICE)

344
23:40.774 --> 23:42.735
[♪ light music playing]

345
23:42.818 --> 23:45.404
[sizzling]

346
23:45.487 --> 23:47.156
[seller] Here you go, ramen and fried rice.

347
23:52.619 --> 23:56.040
Ma'am, this combo really hits the spot!

348
23:56.123 --> 23:57.332
[seller] Thanks.

349
23:58.042 --> 23:59.376
[Chiko] This is so good.

350
23:59.460 --> 24:02.963
MARUHACHI CHINESE RESTAURANT

351
24:03.047 --> 24:05.466
[♪ closing theme music playing]
